        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vitas Gerulaitis, Heather Watson, Thomas Johansson\n- Events: 1978 Australian Open – Men's Singles\n- Sports: Tennis\n\nFacts:\n- Vitas Gerulaitis was born on July 26, 1954, and died on September 17, 1994.\n- Vitas Gerulaitis was an American professional tennis player.\n- In the 1978 Australian Open – Men's Singles, Vitas Gerulaitis was the defending champion but did not compete.\n- Heather Watson was born on 19 May 1992.\n- Heather Watson is a British tennis player and a Wimbledon Mixed Doubles Champion.\n- Thomas Johansson won an ATP Masters Series title at the 1999 Canada Masters.\n- Thomas Johansson won a Grand Slam singles title at the 2002 Australian Open.",
